  "details": "So the Idea Behind it is that VRChat now has the Drop Share system. Why not use that to Share avatars as well?\n\nMeaning that when your in the avatar menu and you click on Avatar Details (As a safety so you dont Click it by Accident) There will be a new Button saying Share avatar. If you Click on it you can Choose between 3 Options. \"Share with- (User/User's in Current world), -Friends Only or Public.\n\nYou can also do this with Privat avatars. But with the Acceptation that there will be a Warning saying \"Do you Really want to share your Privat avatar?\"\n\nThe Catch is that the Users that Coppie Privat Avatars cant Share it or let it get Cloned in any way the Only way to get the Privat Avatars is by the Person Who Uploaded them.",
